{"abstract":"Transitioning a company from product-centricity to a new service-centred offering requires substantial changes, which can have deep implications for the company’s processes, structure, and technology. Strategic thinking can help managers and employees to plan and cope with change. Our paper offers empirical insight into how a Danish IT company that is transitioning to being service-centric hosted and facilitated a set of design workshops to foster strategic thinking across the organization. Such design workshops were structured to invite participants to adopt multiple perspectives and think through different temporalities, while mediating the interaction to allow diverse perspectives to emerge.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Harre, Olivia","Simeone, Luca","Nielsen, Lene"],"cuid":["S02-086.84-001675"],"event":{"end":"2021-10-16","place":"Online","start":"2021-10-11","title":"14th European Academy of Design Conference 2021","year":"2021"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Design workshop","Design workshops","IT company","Organizational change","Service Design","service centric transformation","strategic thinking"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"moving from products to services supporting strategic thinking through design workshops","src":["aau","itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/450316593/EAD2021_Design_workshops_and_strategic_thinking_CAMERA_READY.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-086.84-001675","ids":["aau-2120086f-6523-474f-906a-559ed16c646e","itu-7508cc96-3863-4458-a3de-e15bbecef651"],"keyword":["Design workshop","IT company","Service Design","design workshops","organizational change","service centricity","service-centric transformation","strategic thinking"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-2-87F0F4F8E04A871069882942FA2B40B8"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/86334070/EAD2021_Design_workshops_and_strategic_thinking_CAMERA_READY.pdf","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/450316593/EAD2021_Design_workshops_and_strategic_thinking_CAMERA_READY.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Business IT","IT University of Copenhagen, Digital Business Innovation, Information Systems and Digital Innovation"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Architecture, Design and Media Technology","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Architecture, Design and Media Technology, Section for Media Technology - Campus Copenhagen","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Architecture, Design and Media Technology, Service Systems Design"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Olivia Thomassen","key":"harrepau","last":"Harre","locid":"8949ca8c-746d-4a53-b816-ec9ebf06764c","name":"Harre, Olivia Thomassen","orcid":"0009-0001-3681-3770","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Luca","key":"simeonepau","last":"Simeone","locid":"a4374675-6d6b-4886-b088-e943964db21a","name":"Simeone, Luca","orcid":"0000-0003-0527-3270","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lene","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"1052b289-f510-4c5a-9662-2db48c12ebc2","name":"Nielsen, Lene","orcid":"0000-0003-1768-7147","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"place":"Lancaster","publisher":"The European Academy of Design","status":"p","subtitle":"Safe harbours for design research","title":"14th European Academy of Design Conference"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-2120086f-6523-474f-906a-559ed16c646e","itu-7508cc96-3863-4458-a3de-e15bbecef651"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University","ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Moving from products to services: Supporting strategic thinking through design workshops","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-086.84-001675","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"This paper explores how an IT company wants to change from product-centricity to servitization. A cross-functional customer journey workshop mapped the current state from the customer’s point of view, and by identifying opportunities, it identifies gaps in becoming a service organization. Activities in the workshop focused on mapping a current customer journey and a proposition of a customer journey. The case explores how a service design workshop and tools can be used in strategic work, to support and facilitate a discussion on changes needed to be customer-centric, going beyond technology and features. The workshop and maps proved useful in facilitating and visualizing the current organizational state and identifying opportunities for what it takes to shift to servitization. This case contributes to practical aspects of how service design tools can support organizational transformation towards servitization.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Harre, Olivia Thomassen","Nielsen, Lene"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-384025"],"event":{"acronym":"ServDes","title":"ServDes - Service Design and Innovation Conference"},"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Customer Centricity","Customer Journey Mapping","Organizational Transformation","Service Design","Servitization"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"from product centricity to services design workshops and maps as tools in strategy articulation","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/85683057/103_Harre_Nielsen_SP.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-384025","ids":["itu-bcbaeac2-f896-48a2-a4d8-3231d6be21df"],"keyword":["Customer Jo